     <p class="lead"><strong>If you are tax resident in Spain and hold bank accounts, securities, funds, insurance or property in another country, you may have to report them to the Spanish Tax Agency on form 720 (modelo 720), even if they produce no income. Grupo Avanza Consultores, tax and accounting adviser in Paterna (Valencia), checks whether you are obliged and for which blocks, prepares and files the return and, if it was not filed on time, prepares the late filing. We advise online across Spain and reply in written English by email.</strong></p>
